; An elided posting whose amount is not zero but rounds to zero at the places written is kept.
2026-01-01 open Assets:A
2026-01-01 open Assets:B
2026-01-01 open Assets:C

2026-01-02 * "a residual below half a cent"
  Assets:A  1.004 EUR
  Assets:B  -1.00 EUR
  Assets:C

2026-01-03 * "a negative residual below half a cent"
  Assets:A  -1.004 EUR
  Assets:B  1.00 EUR
  Assets:C

2026-01-04 * "half a cent rounds to the even zero"
  Assets:A  1.005 EUR
  Assets:B  -1.00 EUR
  Assets:C

2026-01-05 * "an exact zero still drops it"
  Assets:A  1.00 EUR
  Assets:B  -1.00 EUR
  Assets:C

2026-01-06 * "only the currency that rounds to zero"
  Assets:A  1.004 EUR
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:B  -1.00 EUR
  Assets:B  -1 USD
  Assets:C

2026-01-07 price EUR 2 USD
2026-01-07 price EUR -2 GBP

2026-01-08 * "a kept -0.00 converts to -0 at a positive rate and to 0 at a negative one"
  Assets:A  1.004 EUR
  Assets:B  -1.00 EUR
  Assets:C
